Changed files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
- cisco_ios_show_version.raw: sanitized with cmd/sanitize. The hostname,
  domains, serial, model and firmware strings were replaced by placeholders,
  the uptime by a fixed value, and the compile and restart timestamp lines
  were removed.
- Every other .raw file: sanitized with cmd/sanitize, which replaced
  addresses, MACs, domains, serials, models and firmware strings with
  documentation values or placeholders and removed timestamp, compile and
  secret-looking lines (in cisco_ios_show_ip_bgp_summary.raw, the two
  "BGP community entries" lines). By hand, neighbour hostnames became
  dev<n> and the remaining model numbers MODEL<n>.
